Thank you so much.

2346
01:27:25,200 --> 01:27:26,100
You're welcome.

2347
01:27:26,435 --> 01:27:27,268
My rainbow rice cake pants.

2348
01:27:27,269 --> 01:27:28,169
(Satisfied)

2349
