2351
01:27:31,942 --> 01:27:33,541
- I love it.
- You don't have to keep it on.

2352
01:27:33,542 --> 01:27:34,442
No, I like it.

2353
01:27:34,443 --> 01:27:35,810
(Won Ji loves the gift.)

2354
01:27:36,412 --> 01:27:38,012
Now, it's your turn.

2355
01:27:38,013 --> 01:27:40,014
(Next up is Won Ji's reveal.)

2356
