2359
01:27:50,160 --> 01:27:52,260
My Secret Santa is...

2360
01:27:52,261 --> 01:27:53,294
(Me?)

2361
01:27:55,131 --> 01:27:56,231
You!

2362
01:27:56,232 --> 01:27:57,566
(Won Ji is Gabee's Secret Santa.)

2363
