my Secret Santa would get it.

2373
01:28:16,318 --> 01:28:17,485
You made the right choice.

2374
01:28:17,486 --> 01:28:18,719
What did Gabee say she wanted?

2375
01:28:18,720 --> 01:28:20,154
What did you say you wanted?

2376
01:28:20,155 --> 01:28:21,222
Won Ji will remember.

2377
01:28:22,091 --> 01:28:24,125
I saw a really pretty one...

2378
01:28:24,126 --> 01:28:25,627
