2382
01:28:29,899 --> 01:28:31,566
Can you close your eyes?

2383
01:28:31,567 --> 01:28:35,303
I couldn't get something too big.

2384
01:28:35,304 --> 01:28:37,572
A small one is fine.

2385
01:28:37,740 --> 01:28:39,774
(Screaming)

2386
01:28:41,710 --> 01:28:42,910
She sounds so happy.

2387
01:28:43,345 --> 01:28:44,979
Exactly!

2388
01:28:44,980 --> 01:28:45,880
