(Laughing hysterically)

2393
01:28:59,295 --> 01:29:01,797
(The celebration continues.)

2394
01:29:02,065 --> 01:29:03,798
It's a golden toad.

2395
01:29:03,799 --> 01:29:05,033
I can feel the luck coming in.

2396
01:29:05,034 --> 01:29:08,136
I couldn't find one on the street
that was a pretty color.

2397
01:29:08,604 --> 01:29:10,505
No, this looks perfect.

2398
01:29:10,506 --> 01:29:11,973
It has jewels on it too.

2399
01:29:12,548 --> 01:29:14,876
(Shining bright)

2400
01:29:14,877 --> 01:29:16,243
Thanks, Won Ji. I love it.

2401
01:29:16,244 --> 01:29:18,313
This is such a warm moment.

2402
01:29:18,314 --> 01:29:19,213
That means you two must be...

2403
01:29:19,214 --> 01:29:21,916
Let us reveal our Secret Santa!

2404
01:29:21,917 --> 01:29:23,717
(Sian and Harimu are a pair.)

2405
01:29:23,718 --> 01:29:25,019
We'll reveal ours at the same time!

2406
01:29:25,354 --> 01:29:27,855
I'll go first.

2407
01:29:27,856 --> 01:29:29,457
It's quite large.

2408
01:29:29,925 --> 01:29:31,159
(A pre-game performance)

2409
01:29:31,260 --> 01:29:32,693
(Slapping)

2410
01:29:33,929 --> 01:29:35,796
For my queen, Sian.

2411
01:29:36,165 --> 01:29:37,031
What could it be?

2412
01:29:40,903 --> 01:29:43,938
(Ta-da)

2413
01:29:44,473 --> 01:29:46,507
I got a set of gifts.

2414
01:29:48,878 --> 01:29:50,513
I love it!

2415
01:29:50,514 --> 01:29:53,849
Since you love elephants so much.

2416
01:29:54,416 --> 01:29:57,351
(An elephant plushie and a tote bag)

2417
01:29:57,686 --> 01:30:00,921
I got about 100 elephants for you.

2418
01:30:01,223 --> 01:30:03,478
(A bunch of elephants for Sian)

2419
01:30:03,505 --> 01:30:04,460
Oh.

2420
01:30:04,565 --> 01:30:07,696
I'm going to dream
about elephants tonight. This is so cute!

2421
01:30:07,963 --> 01:30:09,805
- I'm collecting elephants.
- Really?

2422
01:30:09,806 --> 01:30:11,406
- I'm collecting them.
- You don't have pink, right?

2423
01:30:11,407 --> 01:30:12,939
I got two elephants today.

2424
01:30:12,940 --> 01:30:14,536
They're all different colors.

2425
01:30:14,606 --> 01:30:16,472
They're totally a set.

2426
01:30:16,473 --> 01:30:18,607
It's a whole set.

2427
01:30:18,907 --> 01:30:19,808
I got...

2428
01:30:19,867 --> 01:30:23,254
(Revealing Harimu's present last)

2429
01:30:23,354 --> 01:30:24,813
Oh.

2430
01:30:25,581 --> 01:30:27,950
One, two, three.

2431
01:30:30,261 --> 01:30:32,354
(Shocked)

2432
01:30:32,901 --> 01:30:34,554
(Spreading out)

2433
01:30:38,127 --> 01:30:40,560
(A door pocket and a mirror)

2434
01:30:40,980 --> 01:30:42,607
(Excitement explodes.)

2435
01:30:42,733 --> 01:30:45,180
- It's a bag.
- It's a bag.

2436
01:30:46,167 --> 01:30:47,469
It's a bag.

2437
01:30:48,113 --> 01:30:49,787
It's a bag.

2438
01:30:50,053 --> 01:30:52,574
It's not a bag, but just wear it like one.

2439
01:30:52,575 --> 01:30:54,575
I think I can carry this around.

2440
01:30:54,576 --> 01:30:56,576
- Yes, I love that.
- It's pretty.

2441
01:30:56,673 --> 01:30:59,448
I think I can even wear it as a dress.

2442
01:31:00,330 --> 01:31:01,617
Of course.

2443
01:31:01,763 --> 01:31:03,218
- Of course.
- Thank you.

2444
01:31:03,250 --> 01:31:04,353
Do you know what this is?

2445
01:31:04,383 --> 01:31:06,422
- Mirror!
- Mirror, mirror on the wall!

2446
01:31:08,276 --> 01:31:09,843
Who's the pretty girl?

2447
01:31:09,844 --> 01:31:12,828
Oh, my gosh! You actually heard that.

2448
01:31:13,376 --> 01:31:15,664
It's so pretty!

2449
01:31:15,665 --> 01:31:16,923
It has everything.

2450
01:31:16,924 --> 01:31:19,968
It has the blue sky, a golden temple,

2451
01:31:20,230 --> 01:31:22,237
and the elephants you love.

2452
01:31:22,571 --> 01:31:24,706
Thank you.

2453
01:31:25,641 --> 01:31:29,311
And there is even a black swan
on the back.

2454
01:31:29,935 --> 01:31:31,180
It's a black swan, not a white one.

2455
01:31:31,595 --> 01:31:32,614
Like me.

2456
01:31:33,508 --> 01:31:34,583
I love it.

2457
01:31:34,628 --> 01:31:37,319
The fact that we exchanged gifts
like this...

2458
01:31:37,388 --> 01:31:38,987
is meaningful in itself.

2459
01:31:39,922 --> 01:31:41,853
It's only our second day together,

2460
01:31:41,854 --> 01:31:43,606
but we bought things
while thinking about one another.

2461
01:31:43,607 --> 01:31:45,127
That alone makes these gifts valuable.

2462
01:31:45,146 --> 01:31:47,146
This is such a sweet moment.

2463
01:31:47,299 --> 01:31:48,931
Let's do Secret Santa more often.

2464
01:31:48,932 --> 01:31:50,958
- This is fun.
- I feel good.

2465
01:31:50,959 --> 01:31:52,959
It feels nice to have someone buy this
for me.

2466
01:31:52,960 --> 01:31:55,537
Then let's close up all our luggage...

2467
01:31:55,732 --> 01:31:57,206
and get ready for bed.

2468
01:31:57,207 --> 01:31:59,180
- Okay.
- Let's put these in.

2469
01:31:59,181 --> 01:32:00,476
Let's put them in.

2470
01:32:01,877 --> 01:32:03,479
Just put them in.

2471
01:32:03,550 --> 01:32:06,215
Here. The frog.

2472
01:32:06,615 --> 01:32:08,383
This is nice and flat.

2473
01:32:08,384 --> 01:32:10,552
That's easy. Very good.

2474
01:32:12,504 --> 01:32:13,655
Okay.

2475
01:32:21,350 --> 01:32:22,831
The Buldak noodles sound delicious.

2476
01:32:23,165 --> 01:32:24,500
Then, shall we eat this now?

2477
01:32:24,928 --> 01:32:28,215
(The queens' night isn't over yet.)

2478
01:32:28,588 --> 01:32:30,839
I'm pouring water into the kimchi ramyeon.

2479
01:32:35,226 --> 01:32:37,446
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

2480
01:32:37,526 --> 01:32:39,848
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

2481
01:32:40,382 --> 01:32:42,484
These dumplings are pretty good.

2482
01:32:43,585 --> 01:32:45,187
Thai convenience stores really know
what they're doing.

2483
01:32:45,871 --> 01:32:46,788
I'm impressed.

2484
01:32:47,631 --> 01:32:51,331
(The Thai convenience store snacks are
perfect for their tastes.)

2485
01:32:52,094 --> 01:32:54,094
Do people
on Single's Inferno really mean it?

2486
01:32:54,237 --> 01:32:56,365
That's what I'm most curious
about when it comes to dating shows.

2487
01:32:56,431 --> 01:32:59,635
Are people completely sincere,
or are they just putting on an act?

2488
01:32:59,724 --> 01:33:01,103
They must be sincere.

2489
01:33:01,370 --> 01:33:02,538
- Really?
- We mean it.

2490
01:33:02,539 --> 01:33:03,372
Really?

2491
01:33:03,373 --> 01:33:05,207
I don't watch dating shows.

2492
01:33:05,208 --> 01:33:06,441
That's understandable.

2493
01:33:06,442 --> 01:33:09,278
Because other people's relationships
don't interest me.

2494
01:33:09,279 --> 01:33:10,408
- Me either.
- Right?

2495
01:33:10,409 --> 01:33:11,636
There are a lot of people like that.

2496
01:33:11,637 --> 01:33:13,637
- But I watched when Sian was on.
- Me too.

2497
01:33:13,638 --> 01:33:15,018
Because it keeps showing up on Reels.

2498
01:33:15,924 --> 01:33:17,452
- Really?
- Really.

2499
01:33:17,511 --> 01:33:19,154
I had never watched a single dating show,

2500
01:33:19,155 --> 01:33:21,590
but I watched
only the episodes you were in.

2501
01:33:22,104 --> 01:33:24,211
Sian has a famous quote from the show.

2502
01:33:24,324 --> 01:33:25,260
What is it?

2503
01:33:26,828 --> 01:33:30,399
"Hello, my name is Lee Sian."

2504
01:33:30,400 --> 01:33:33,001
"I joined Single's Inferno..."

2505
01:33:33,602 --> 01:33:38,207
"because this is a rare moment
when I don't have a boyfriend."

2506
01:33:38,589 --> 01:33:39,508
"A rare moment?"

2507
01:33:39,509 --> 01:33:42,344
So, there's hardly ever a time
when she doesn't have a boyfriend.

2508
01:33:42,535 --> 01:33:45,180
That's how that Reel blew up.

2509
01:33:46,395 --> 01:33:48,917
But is this another one
of those rare moments now?

2510
01:33:50,167 --> 01:33:51,753
Has that rare moment come around again?

2511
01:33:52,020 --> 01:33:54,656
Gabee, what do you do
when you meet someone you like?

2512
01:33:54,780 --> 01:33:56,325
- I'm so curious.
- Flirting?

2513
01:33:56,480 --> 01:33:57,893
As for flirting,

2514
01:33:58,020 --> 01:33:59,647
I just go straight.

2515
01:34:00,905 --> 01:34:02,297
I ask him out for a meal.

2516
01:34:03,898 --> 01:34:05,234
What's your type?

2517
01:34:05,278 --> 01:34:06,668
I want him to be cool.

2518
01:34:07,135 --> 01:34:08,103
Well.

2519
01:34:08,704 --> 01:34:10,872
This rare moment might last quite a while.

2520
01:34:12,563 --> 01:34:13,970
This rare moment will get longer.

2521
01:34:13,971 --> 01:34:15,043
Right.

2522
01:34:15,403 --> 01:34:17,012
I love that you two take
so many pictures for us.

2523
01:34:17,013 --> 01:34:18,013
Right.

2524
01:34:18,350 --> 01:34:20,262
The photos are what remain in the end.

2525
01:34:20,283 --> 01:34:22,283
That's so cute.

2526
01:34:23,147 --> 01:34:29,801
(The four of them continued talking
for quite a while.)

2527
01:34:30,720 --> 01:34:32,794
Today was great too.

2528
01:34:33,395 --> 01:34:34,285
That was delicious.

2529
01:34:35,163 --> 01:34:36,465
Let's go to bed now.

2530
01:34:37,899 --> 01:34:39,368
She finally said what she wanted to.

2531
01:34:39,545 --> 01:34:42,972
(Last cheers)

2532
01:34:43,272 --> 01:34:45,272
I feel really full
now that I'm standing up.

2533
01:34:45,563 --> 01:34:46,883
- Good night.
- Good night.

2534
01:34:46,884 --> 01:34:48,644
- Good night.
- Good night.

2535
01:34:50,178 --> 01:34:51,747
Good night.

2536
01:34:52,057 --> 01:34:55,930
(Their second night
in Bangkok comes to an end.)

2537
01:34:57,088 --> 01:34:59,740
Shall I check your fortune for today?
I heard there is a famous place here.

2538
01:34:59,741 --> 01:35:01,957
- It's that uniquely Thai kind of...
- Fortune-telling?

2539
01:35:02,958 --> 01:35:04,092
Astrology.

2540
01:35:04,926 --> 01:35:06,261
What is that?

2541
01:35:06,262 --> 01:35:07,863
- She's writing something.
- She's so serious.

2542
01:35:07,993 --> 01:35:09,231
This is what your fortune says.

2543
01:35:09,393 --> 01:35:10,465
(Unintelligible)

2544
01:35:10,726 --> 01:35:11,419
(Everyone is shocked.)

2545
01:35:11,559 --> 01:35:12,367
That's true.

2546
01:35:12,426 --> 01:35:14,069
I was thinking that in my mind.

2547
01:35:14,303 --> 01:35:16,138
(You have to watch your mouth.)

2548
01:35:16,373 --> 01:35:19,299
(A sudden warning
and even a possible hospitalization?)

2549
01:35:19,727 --> 01:35:22,311
I will take you to the amulet market now.

2550
01:35:22,944 --> 01:35:24,944
- What is this?
- There's a QR here.

2551
01:35:25,133 --> 01:35:26,348
A lucky chance?

2552
01:35:26,393 --> 01:35:28,784
"Tonight, grab your lucky chance."

2553
01:35:28,984 --> 01:35:31,053
"The way to a lucky place. Click."

2554
01:35:31,673 --> 01:35:32,554
What is this?

2555
01:35:32,647 --> 01:35:35,023
They said it went out of business.
Is this a haunted experience?

2556
01:35:35,693 --> 01:35:37,426
This feels
like a famous Thai horror movie.

2557
01:35:37,427 --> 01:35:38,627
This place feels eerie.

2558
01:35:38,814 --> 01:35:39,895
That's so scary.

2559
01:35:39,896 --> 01:35:42,030
Oh, my gosh!

2560
01:35:42,234 --> 01:35:44,199
No, I don't want to do this.

2561
01:35:44,487 --> 01:35:45,167
What?

2562
01:35:45,834 --> 01:35:48,178
(There is even an ominous energy
in the air.)

2563
01:35:48,298 --> 01:35:49,071
(Gasping)

2564
01:35:49,072 --> 01:35:50,806
I don't think there's any luck.

2565
01:35:51,125 --> 01:35:52,541
Look how the glass is broken.

2566
01:35:52,698 --> 01:35:54,209
I've never tried this in my life.

2567
01:35:54,443 --> 01:35:55,644
Hold on. This is too scary.

2568
01:35:55,745 --> 01:35:58,180
There's nothing inside.
Hold on. What was that?

2569
01:35:58,411 --> 01:36:00,482
Don't you think
there's something over there?

2570
01:36:00,682 --> 01:36:03,018
Is it just me,
or is there something over there?

2571
01:36:03,085 --> 01:36:04,686
I don't think that's a human.

2572
01:36:05,053 --> 01:36:07,356
(What kind of good luck awaits them?)

2573
01:36:07,554 --> 01:36:10,340
Are they really telling us to go inside?

2574
01:36:10,407 --> 01:36:11,641
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
